[{"title":"送戴尊师入越","author":"杨载","text":"跃马年年塞北游，春风此日送归舟。\n山中树老飞玄鹤，江上莎长卧白鸥。\n欲与谢公同隐逸，肯容贺老独风流。\n山阴道士如相见，沽取村醪醉未休。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23905,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赋飞鸿送胡则大","author":"杨载","text":"年年客里见飞鸿，成阵成行上碧空。\n杳杳江湖寻故侣，萧萧芦苇下新丛。\n翱翔已出云霄上，饮啄宁来沼沚中。\n今日似君归去好，扁舟一夜起东风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23906,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵萧君用","author":"杨载","text":"崔嵬出水翠云浮，舁轿拖舟岂厌游。\n澶漫渠河方涉夏，萧条竹树已迎秋。\n衔杯兴尽人先醉，舞剑歌长客易愁。\n八月江湖翻渤澥，长竿更约与君投。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23907,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"杨载","text":"庭树号蝉日已凉，寒云横雁夜何长。\n挟书万里千明主，仗剑三年别故乡。\n西北诸山连朔漠，东南众水隔荆扬。\n淹留不去惭苏子，莫遣貂裘厌雪霜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23908,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"杨载","text":"秋郊纵步却骖驔，胜事能多许客参。\n如雪万家收早稻，未霜千树著黄柑。\n鼍鸣海上潮先涌，猿叫山前雾欲含。\n放浪渔樵元有处，使人犹爱住江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23909,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偕汪侯宴舟中","author":"杨载","text":"中流画鹢独翱翔，暂勒鸣驺驻岸旁。\n风引锦帆冲野色，波随兰棹泛晴光。\n草涵宿润珠玑滑，麦涨春云饼饵香。\n何事乘槎之海上，问津从此达天潢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23910,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题胡伯衡飞云图","author":"杨载","text":"未应时命固相违，千里遨游久不归。\n已占龙头承紫诏，更蕲马首赐朱衣。\n尘沙客路牵愁远，泉石家乡入梦稀。\n日夜思亲心更切，沧浪怅望白云飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23911,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吴山晚眺","author":"杨载","text":"山椒翚构四垂宽，上相旌旗会览观。\n傍近江湖天广大，上连星斗地清寒。\n龙宫永锁函书閟，凤岭重嗟苑树残。\n此际独无云蔽日，正宜翘首望长安。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23912,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"杨载","text":"门前高柳绿纷纷，恋霭留烟昼不分。\n雨砌芳菲晴后见，风窗言语静中闻。\n桐花可作凤凰食，竹叶还成虎豹文。\n但使此心无外慕，卜居何用绝人群。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23913,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夏夜对月","author":"杨载","text":"暑天烦倦唯酣寝，薄暮登楼起宿痾。\n簟报新秋凉意早，窗开永夜月明多。\n不眠孤鹤频惊叫，好事流萤屡见过。\n安得泛舟江海上，坐观冰镜落沧波。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23914,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题高尚书竹石","author":"杨载","text":"矫龙疑苍筠，踞虎肖白石。\n傥乘风云会，变化那可测。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23915,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题墨竹为郑尊师","author":"杨载","text":"风味既淡泊，颜色不妩媚。\n孤生崖谷间，有此凌云气。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23916,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中即事四首 其一","author":"杨载","text":"渐觉星星两鬓皤，推愁不去奈愁何！\n客中忘却春光度，惊见前林嫩竹多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23917,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中即事四首 其二","author":"杨载","text":"终朝矻矻坐书帷，春去春来总不知。\n怪得山禽如有意，隔窗撩乱踏花枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23918,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中即事四首 其三","author":"杨载","text":"几日悬悬雨不休，客窗孤迥使人愁。\n杜鹃啼切知何处？\n坐对云山万木稠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23919,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客中即事四首 其四","author":"杨载","text":"美木千章绕故宫，如烟如雾塞虚空。\n路冲南北山冈断，披拂能来万里风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23920,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼邻妓二首 其一","author":"杨载","text":"西子湖边杨柳花，随风飘泊到天涯。\n青春遇著归来燕，衔入当年王谢家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23921,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼邻妓二首 其二","author":"杨载","text":"一种腰肢分外妍，双眉画作月娟娟。\n春风吹破襄王梦，行雨行云若个边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23922,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沙雁","author":"杨载","text":"漠漠寒烟树影微，一行沙雁背人飞。\n江南江北秋将尽，客子如今犹未归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23923,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"扇上竹","author":"杨载","text":"种竹何须种万竿，一枝分影亦檀栾。\n秋宵更受风披拂，听取清声入梦寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23924,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵康子山舍人二首 其一","author":"杨载","text":"兼旬风雨气寒凉，院落幽深草木长。\n却喜今年多夏果，碧苞丹实满林香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23925,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵康子山舍人二首 其二","author":"杨载","text":"欲赏秋花色已凉，碧云散尽楚天长。\n姮娥旧种无多树，何故人间有此香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23926,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"到京师","author":"杨载","text":"城雪初消荠菜生，角门深巷少人行。\n柳梢听得黄鹂语，此是春来第一声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23927,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送人二首 其一","author":"杨载","text":"客路逢春雪乍消，眼前愁思转相撩。\n垂杨染作黄金色，舞遍东风万万条。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23928,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送人二首 其二","author":"杨载","text":"金沟河上始通流，海子桥边系客舟。\n却到江南春水涨，拍天波浪泛轻鸥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23929,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹石","author":"杨载","text":"林前怪石起参差，篁竹丛深使客疑。\n如过潇湘江上路，鹧鸪啼罢日西时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23930,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题十二红卷子","author":"杨载","text":"碧桃枝上有珍禽，调舌交交听好音。\n画出江南春意思，明年携酒共追寻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23931,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"杨载","text":"楼外斜阳放晚晴，街衢前后听欢声。\n回舟更倚南风顺，千里青山照眼明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23932,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪梦二首 其一","author":"杨载","text":"四面青山拥翠微，楼台相向辟天扉。\n夜阑每作游仙梦，月满琼田万鹤飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23933,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪梦二首 其二","author":"杨载","text":"纷纷鸾鹤满虚空，耳畔如闻度海风。\n直上云霄千万里，此身飞入紫微宫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23934,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用韵送德阳入越为赘婿","author":"杨载","text":"轻薄薄雾诘朝晴，岸柳江梅著树明。\n更向若耶溪上听，旁人歌唱尽春声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23935,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵雪","author":"杨载","text":"砑光帽子舞山花，吹落曾城万仞斜。\n安得飙轮为我驾，一时飞到列仙家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23936,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阳关图","author":"杨载","text":"咸阳西距玉门关，万里征人惮往还。\n此别尊前须尽醉，相逢俱是鬓毛斑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23937,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"杨载","text":"檐外喧喧雀报晴，夕阳犹照小窗明。\n回舟更倚南风顺，要听田家打麦声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23938,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"乐会县","author":"范梈","text":"早发端赵村，莫投乐会县。\n县阻道路长，但见水葱茜。\n轻风掠溪麋，好月触石面。\n前行日已分，后从气犹昡。\n役者向我言，前年土豪变。\n黄旗伐画鼓，樵屋拟牙殿。\n居民绝烟爨，搬并入淮甸。\n却又遭劫杀，流动靡安奠。\n群夷尽蜂起，尽用血洗箭。\n公然肆浡暴，请与官军战。\n官军幸努力，摧落得深便。\n虽获覆其巢，奸愚不胜谴。\n于今郊原间，芳草白骨遍。\n我行适夜分，听此毛发旋。\n前冈明炬火，叫应欣蹂践。\n官吏候我来，始与人相见。\n沿河岛沚深，问路山田转。\n啾啾乌鸟鸣，靡靡鞍马倦。\n一从违京国，几度梦霜霰。\n何所非异乡，开怀谢身健。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23939,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"即事","author":"范梈","text":"随地居能胜，因人景倍饶。\n折风疏菡萏，移雨近芭蕉。\n放浪明高蹈，留连近久要。\n虚心待世虑，已任过云飘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23940,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"苏李会合图","author":"范梈","text":"未识沙场苦，空曾奉使来。\n讵知羝乳约，不抵雁书回。\n汉节风霜古，胡笳旦暮哀。\n谁怜太史令，心为故人摧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23941,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"六月初十夜雨止玩月有感","author":"范梈","text":"雨歇青林迥，虚斋生夕凉。\n帘帷方度月，枕簟已怀霜。\n地角家何在，云端路转长。\n慈帏近安否，归觐不能忘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23942,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王武子相马图","author":"范梈","text":"偶然来厩吏，唤作九方皋。\n毁誉依名立，周旋逐物劳。\n神驰风电足，眼冷雪霜毛。\n事有遭逢者，骐驎固自高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23943,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"八月十五夜","author":"范梈","text":"城上初闻柝，天边独倚楼。\n可怜今夜月，还照异乡秋。\n烛暗频移席，帘虚不上钩。\n回文锦机字，写得大刀头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23944,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"风雨","author":"范梈","text":"风雨忽如此，空山方昼眠。\n故应为计拙，可复要人怜。\n灯火乡村路，桑麻杜曲田。\n悠悠今视昔，把卷一茫然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23945,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠别南剑李使君三十韵","author":"范梈","text":"北户群山表，南云九域西。\n君今行欲遍，此意别都迷。\n妙句人谁识，前年手自题。\n绝崖钩象译，悬径摘乌栖。\n炎隩通冠冕，边陲重璧圭。\n礼新尊玺节，名故籍金闺。\n劳有恩言切，归无宠数跻。\n宸心端外见，庙谊肯中稽。\n望誉腾青琐，辉光拂紫泥。\n旌麾深假借，民社载扶携。\n猛气排苍鹄，幽思启碧鸡。\n动应多惬会，行岂强扳提。\n皂盖喧童稚，黄堂拜耄倪。\n天机驯虎兕，帝力及凫鹥。\n越厉冬深少，闽烟晚向凄。\n野人封水竹，郡吏接山溪。\n汊碧荷香弱，坡红木实齐。\n九秋鹏鹗翮，万里骕骦蹄。\n导从罗弓矢，登临按鼓鼙。\n少须《青玉案》，与报《白铜鞮》。\n忠信先蛮貊，文章协壁奎。\n孰云当近服，不遂慰烝黎。\n执手关河早，论交岁月暌。\n物华盈眼乱，春色傍人低。\n谢豹空洲隐，王鸠远树啼。\n国容方整整，旅病转悽悽。\n谬忝词垣密，微能官秩卑。\n从班窥遂霸，浪漫笑山嵇。\n何日同樽酒，因风独杖藜。\n延平宝剑气，旦旦候虹霓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23946,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄甄氏访山亭二十二韵","author":"范梈","text":"青子亭何许，滹沱旧水头。\n谷陵千载异，风物四时幽。\n城郭长无事，琴尊或此游。\n窗摅平野秀，户接乱泉流。\n猿鸟相宾送，渔樵互献酬。\n太行晴日近，碣石晚烟稠。\n莽莽青天外，离离碧海陬。\n都将神迹化，只可笑谈求。\n大槛花周映，虚阶叶竟抽。\n岂容黄壤污，祇为白云留。\n更就诸峰老，宁须万户侯。\n心知嗜好酷，势肯去来休。\n予亦寻山者，人疑避世俦。\n偶然依紫阙，不是谢丹丘。\n薄与江湖远，频嗟岁月周。\n梦尝经五岳，思屡绕三洲。\n室宇凭谁寄，园林誓自收。\n把书消旦暮，种药引春秋。\n地僻澄官冗，天空扫旅愁。\n几时携古剑，万里觅扁舟。\n剩想高人趣，空怀贱子羞。\n犹胜徐市俗，瀛岛计悠悠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23947,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晓山谣赠别金陵陈处士","author":"范梈","text":"昔我望天岳，于时春正深。\n鸡鸣九州陌，鹤警万花林。\n旭日腾重海，宵霞映别岑。\n露条承嶪巀，雪涧泻嵚崟。\n马足无由定，莺声不可寻。\n畏钟牵逸览，挂笏系虚襟。\n每想丘中趣，如悬空外音。\n十秋伤逝水，千壑记扪参。\n晚遇陈夫子，高谈契夙心。\n天形疏造化，月眼识浮沈。\n宦路悲怀玉，君门惜和琴。\n岂因平旦气，薄示暮年箴。\n但恐丹崖失，何愁素发侵。\n会当期绝巘，与尔鍊黄金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23948,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠裴秀才","author":"范梈","text":"江边见立春，花老问征人。\n物色随乡异，风光逐候新。\n朝廷方贵士，经术足谋身。\n举世皆腾踏，如君独隐沦。\n鸣山应鸑鷟，在野决麒麟。\n已用遗经试，宁辞累牍陈。\n飘飖行李别，缱绻酒杯频。\n四海多英俊，诸公自等伦。\n云霄开大道，溟涨接通津。\n百啭仓庚近，双飞蛱蝶匀。\n款留俱酝藉，归到莫逡巡。\n肯薄传家赋，犹堪博钓纶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23949,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠别邓修撰归杭州","author":"范梈","text":"东风二月禁门莺，天上佳人有远行。\n惜路频瞻霞上日，望家直到海边城。\n休须满假辞三径，定约重来赋《二京》。\n回首津亭万家柳，初非憔悴独关情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23950,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"谢冷架阁春日东麓见怀","author":"范梈","text":"空谷白驹消息迟，东风杨柳万烟丝。\n佩环忆为同心赠，书榜传看俊手施。\n曾以陋居追往昔，却因嘉遁感今兹。\n相思恐涉山灵怪，不遇仙人不记诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23951,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄题龚氏山园","author":"范梈","text":"居士名园何处求，无有是中风物幽。\n岩花故解分藤缀，涧水新能合竹流。\n绿幕黄帘围玉树，青天白日映朱楼。\n醉吟自尔人难识，况是心轻万户侯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23952,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五月二十日发雷州过徐文次驿候役者不至留二日","author":"范梈","text":"久约归吴弄钓舟，海天羁思复悠悠。\n谁知树底春生月，独坐人间地尽头。\n粉壁旧题分藓读，瓦罂新酒接花篘。\n边鸿固是南来绝，绝为雷城信滞留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23953,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送元经历赴广东","author":"范梈","text":"番禺直北望长沙，元帅持戈镇海涯。\n万里送君归幕府，几时为我寄梅花。\n云蒸巨浪鱼吹岸，柳压荒山獠阵牙。\n欲托乡书妨枉骑，湄湘西上是吾家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23954,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寿宫","author":"范梈","text":"武帝初行祀灶方，祠官宫女俨分行。\n石阑井井通金殿，金盖童童出画墙。\n但见扰龙呼作相，未闻骑鹤拜为郎。\n祇今松柏缘原庙，时接云軿下大荒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23955,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠陈提举","author":"范梈","text":"便令回首绾青银，已负南宫第一人。\n文武既兴殷士贡，申辕犹比汉儒真。\n离鸿苦事风霜急，伏骥深心道路亲。\n若遇清溪寻旧隐，洗觞犹及艾陵春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23956,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"公堂暇日","author":"范梈","text":"新起危楼接大荒，海天奇观压殊方。\n周墙恨未高千尺，犹见他家竹短长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23957,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"将如靖安徐文学自新拿舟来候良有古意以诗留别","author":"范梈","text":"西风危栈逼青云，稍下临江细路分。\n问县尚须穷日到，棹歌无计得留君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23958,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀京城诸公书崖州驿四首 其一","author":"范梈","text":"甚忆清河元侍讲，送行犹有玉堂诗。\n只今夜夜陇头月，照见征人有所思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23959,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀京城诸公书崖州驿四首 其二","author":"范梈","text":"复忆济南张吏部，作诗文气压诸公。\n佳儿亦是门生辈，尚想他年似若翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23960,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀京城诸公书崖州驿四首 其三","author":"范梈","text":"绣衣御史果能文，蜀道新来有李君。\n记得京城黄菊烂，为余来觅董将军。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23961,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀京城诸公书崖州驿四首 其四","author":"范梈","text":"妙为文字吾雄甲，精切于今孰与俦。\n说著奉常虞博士，恨渠犹不见崖州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23962,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"县下凿池种树成聚晨起视水深五寸而草树承夜雨后苍翠郁然可爱戏题厅柱","author":"范梈","text":"槟榔池上芭蕉雨，更种垂杨十六株。\n中有玉堂萧散吏，检书正对《辋川图》。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23963,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至乌石邸舍二首 其一","author":"范梈","text":"不见居人只见村，离家茅屋又黄昏。\n面前沧海来无际，闻说占城对县门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23964,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至乌石邸舍二首 其二","author":"范梈","text":"苦竹丛西石色乌，来时依旧驿亭孤。\n自从历遍崖州路，不敢弯弓射鹧鸪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23965,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"福州杂诗三首 其一","author":"范梈","text":"前日题诗自侯官，计程今日到云端。\n家人定得平安字，最念痴儿不解看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23966,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"福州杂诗三首 其二","author":"范梈","text":"海隅霜熟蛎房肥，狮子桥东望翠微。\n安得建阳一斗酒，少随甘旨到柴扉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23967,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"福州杂诗三首 其三","author":"范梈","text":"虎豹几曾惊石鼓，鱼龙独解隐金沙。\n遮藏翠荔馀千刹，掩映朱霞倚万家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23968,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至海口","author":"范梈","text":"曾随仙仗集灵台，流落于今岂不材。\n但比麻姑休狡狯，两行持节过蓬莱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23969,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"二月二十四日自琼州出白沙驿阻风二日不得渡海是日有幕客送寒衣却出赋诗","author":"范梈","text":"盲风怪雨一时清，又阻扁舟两日程。\n天意似将留客住，明朝浮海看清明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23970,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"郁林次韵寄怀王天辅知事","author":"范梈","text":"乍喜连山瘴雾收，黛眉更自锁乡愁。\n自从行李违沧海，九日初逢第二州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23971,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]